    "text": "<p><math><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mi>&#160;</mi></math> (Area outside the parabola)<br /><br /><math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi></math> (Area inside the circle)<br /><br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/jay12354567.JPG\" style=\"width: 137px; height: 118px;\" /><br />Finding point of intersection of the curves, we get,&nbsp;<br /><br /><math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi></math> and <math><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>and</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi>if</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>&#177;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo></math><br /><br />Coordinates of <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>B</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br />As <math><mi>x</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>y</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>0</mn></math> only area above <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math>-axis&nbsp;would be considered.</p><p>Hence, area<br /><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mrow><munderover><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#8747;</mo><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></munderover><mrow><msqrt><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></msqrt></mrow></mrow><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mi>&#160;</mi><mrow><munderover><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#8747;</mo><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></munderover><mrow><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced><mi>&#160;</mi></math><br /><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mrow><munderover><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#8747;</mo><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></munderover><mrow><msqrt><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></msqrt></mrow></mrow><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mi>&#160;</mi><mrow><munderover><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#8747;</mo><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></munderover><mrow><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mi>&#160;</mi><msqrt><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>.</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo>-</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mi>&#160;</mi><msubsup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup></math><br /><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>.</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>]</mo><mi>&#160;=</mi></math><math><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mro